Layak diambil fatwa-fatwanya. Bagaimana gak layak?

66
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:24,340
Kata Imam Yafi'i tadi,

67
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:27,340
Muftil anam.

68
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:30,340
Muftinya manusia.

69
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:34,340
Dan Al-Imam Ibnul Qathir juga mengatakan,

70
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:43,140
al-Imam, al-Allama, Sheikhul Madhab, ini guru besarnya Madhab Shafi'i.

71
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:48,740
Oleh karena itu, hadirin ya Allah muliakan.

72
