83
00:10:57,160 --> 00:11:01,160
Mengikuti para sahabat, muhajirin dan ansur.

84
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:05,160
Makanya kan Allah katakan, coba dibuka, atawba'at 100,

85
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:08,160
