88
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:14,160
Muhajirin dan ansur.

89
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:16,160
Para sahabat Nabi, sallallahu alaihi wa sallam.

90
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:22,660
Kenapa mengikuti para sahabat dirinya oleh Allah SWT?

91
