146
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:19,540
Sebagaimana yang dikatakan Al-Imam Ibnu Al-Attar.

147
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:26,540
Kata beliau, guruku ini sadikan fi kulli dhalika tariqata salaf.

148
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:33,540
Guruku itu menempuh jalan generasi terbaik.

149
00:17:33,540 --> 00:17:39,540
Sahabat radhiyallahu ta'ala anhum, tabiin dan atba'ut tabiin,

150
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,540
Itu dikatakan dalam kejam Tufatul Talibin.

151
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:45,900
Dan saudaraku,

152
